{
 "schema": "fmc-recipe/0.1",
 "family": "FMC_L_SiteFurniture_Gate_Sliding_Main",
 "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
 "about": "Sliding gate modelled as a generic product: ground track under the leaf (the 5.8 m parking run behind the guide posts shows at Medium, kept off Fine so the leaf reads), leaf with bottom, mid and top rails, stiles and thirty pickets, V-wheels, gear rack, receiver post and catch, twin guide posts with rollers, operator on a plinth with pinion, photocells, warning lamp, sign. Geometry drawn for 6m_Motorised; the other types share it (sizes in the values). Reference: query: site furniture gate sliding main site hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=site+furniture+gate+sliding+main+site+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
